- C@2000: diceCount 0 AND strips visible (census CP2 — swap not yet landed).
- P-swap: `stateAt(CONFIG, CONFIG.passes[0].tMs)` → 2500 ms: diceCount = CONFIG.passes[0].count = 9, strips gone, every die size = dieBasePx × passes[0].sizeFactor = 37.
- C@3000: diceCount = 9 (census CP3; between passes 0 and 1).
- P1: `stateAt(CONFIG, CONFIG.passes[1].tMs)` → 3500 ms: diceCount = 15 = CONFIG.passes[1].count.
- C@4000: diceCount = 15 (census CP4).
- P2: `stateAt(CONFIG, CONFIG.passes[2].tMs)` → 4500 ms: diceCount = 18; dice added by pass 2 have size 37 × 0.94 = 34.78.
- C@5000: diceCount = 18 (census CP5).
- P3: `stateAt(CONFIG, CONFIG.passes[3].tMs)` → 5600 ms: diceCount = 56; mean size of pass-3 dice < mean size of pass-0 dice (multiplication shrinks).
- C@6000: diceCount = 56 (census CP6).
- P4: `stateAt(CONFIG, CONFIG.passes[4].tMs)` → 6500 ms: diceCount = 84; smallest die size = 37 × 0.38 = 14.06.
